# Runtime state that must NEVER enter an image. All of these are gitignored, so a CI build from a
# fresh checkout never had them — but a build from a working checkout did, and `DEPLOYMENT.md`
# documents building from source. `data/` alone was 563MB of a real client's SQLite database
# (app.db plus its backups) copied into every locally-built image.
data
backups
uploads
storage
